Package: snapshot-menu
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, desktop-file-utils
Description: SnapshOT categorized tool menu (Kali-style)
 A Kali-style Xfce applications menu for SnapshOT: eight numbered engagement-phase
 folders (Recon, Traffic Analysis, Protocol Tools, Firmware & Hardware, Wireless &
 SDR, Forensics & Response, Reporting, Reference) at the top level, with the stock
 Xfce categories nested under "Usual Applications". Ships the tool launchers, the
 folder definitions, the root menu (diverting libgarcon-common's
 xfce-applications.menu) and a helper that keeps CLI tool output on screen.
